body:
- updates to MSM2 Suits Menu (by patrickisaway):
- fix issue with replacing Miles suits;
- when changing story suits, also apply the change to special cutscene models (symbiote removal, etc);
- allow to choose webwings per suit;
- when replacing suit model, also transfer that suit's styles.

- added option to support commandline.txt (by Pcniado);
- updates to MSM2 Suits Menu (by patrickisaway):
- suit models replacement, including cutscenes/story suits;
- changing suits' Spider-Arms;
- actual suits removal.

- 'scripts_proxy.dll' improvements (by LDD565);
- removed 'tocm' support;
- added CLI, so other tools could integrate Overstrike.

QoL release

- 'toc' change detection;
- automatic 'errors.log' display;
- .script dependencies version rules improvement;
- minor fixes.

- script mods support (currently for MSM2 only);
- updated Settings to allow scripting (DISABLED by default);
- implemented new 'tocm' installation (experimental).

Thanks to LDD565 for writing and sharing the proxy .dll code.

QoL release

- added option to automatically check for updates on launch;
- added "Reset 'toc'" menu option;
- fixed .stage failing to install if it contains empty files.

- added "Clear All" option in menu;
- added hash tool;
- improved speeds of some toc- and DSAR-related operations.
